| 04 | [SPSC ring + O(1) MA](04_spsc_ring/) | C++20 | 0009, 0010 | Lock-free SPSC queue with release/acquire + cache-line padding; O(1) moving average |
| 05 | [VHDL testbenches](05_vhdl_testbench/) | VHDL | 0002 | GHDL testbenches for all three `fpga/*.vhd` modules |
| 06 | [C++ order book](06_cpp_order_book/) | C++20 | 0016 | Port the Python LOB to C++ with `std::map` + FIFO deques; integer tick prices; O(1) cancel index |
| 07 | [Binary feed handler](07_feed_handler/) | C++20 | 0011, 0013 | Parse an ITCH-inspired packed binary message stream into `BookEvent`s; zero allocation on the hot path |
